#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:4
msgid "大規模モデルのLi拡散係数"
msgstr "Li Diffusion Coefficient in the Large Model"

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:6
msgid ""
"文献と同じ組成・原子数のモデルを使うと、Li拡散の温度依存性はどこまで一致するでしょうか。\\ "
"1006原子モデルの活性化エネルギーはCHGNetで0.296 eVでした。文献NNP-MDの0.55 "
"eVと、薄膜実験で得られた0.55～0.58 eVを下回ります。"
msgstr ""
"How closely does the temperature dependence of Li diffusion match the "
"published results for a model of the same composition and atom count? \\ "
"The CHGNet activation energy for the 1006-atom model was 0.296 eV, below "
"both the 0.55 eV from NNP-MD (Li et al.) and the 0.55–0.58 eV from thin-"
"film experiments."

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:14
msgid "1006原子モデルの拡散係数"
msgstr "Diffusion Coefficient of the 1006-Atom Model"

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:16
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":numref:`{number}. {name} <li3po4-doc-large-structure-rdf>` "
"の1006原子モデル（Li₃₇₂P₁₂₈O₅₀₆）を、QuloudのGPU上でCHGNetを使って計算しました。\\ "
":numref:`li3po4-diffusivity-1006atoms` の600、700、800、1000、1200 "
"Kの5点を直線で近似し、拡散の活性化エネルギーとして :math:`0.296\\pm0.008` eVを得ました。\\ ±0.008 "
"eVはこの直線近似の不確かさです。構造の選び方、軌跡長、拡散係数を求める時間範囲の影響は別途評価する必要があります（技術ノートの\\ "
"`平均二乗変位の解釈と限界 <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/diffusion.html#msd-"
"interpretation-limits>`__）。"
msgstr ""
"We used the 1006-atom model (Li₃₇₂P₁₂₈O₅₀₆) from :numref:`{number}. "
"{name} <li3po4-doc-large-structure-rdf>` and ran CHGNet on a GPU in "
"Quloud. \\ :numref:`li3po4-diffusivity-1006atoms` shows the straight line"
" we fitted to five points at 600, 700, 800, 1000, and 1200 K, from which "
"we obtained an activation energy for diffusion of :math:`0.296\\pm0.008` "
"eV. \\ The ±0.008 eV quantifies the uncertainty of this straight-line "
"fit. The effects of structure selection, trajectory length, and the time "
"range used to obtain the diffusion coefficient need separate evaluation "
"(see \\ `interpretation and limitations of mean squared displacement "
"<https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/diffusion.html#msd-interpretation-"
"limits>`__ in the Technical Notes)."

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:22
msgid "1006原子モデルの5温度の拡散係数。アレニウス近似による活性化エネルギーは0.296 eV"
msgstr ""
"Diffusion coefficients for the 1006-atom model at five temperatures. The "
"Arrhenius fit gives an activation energy of 0.296 eV."

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:27
msgid ""
"1006原子モデルのLi拡散係数。赤丸は本計算、赤線はアレニウス式による近似。\\ 縦軸は拡散係数の常用対数で、 :numref:`li3po4"
"-diffusivity-31atoms` の縦軸は自然対数です。常用対数の軸での傾きの換算は技術ノートの\\ `アレニウス式 <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/thermal_activation.html#arrhenius-"
"equation>`__\\ にあります。"
msgstr ""
"Li diffusion coefficient in the 1006-atom model. The red circles are from"
" this work, and the red line is a fit to the Arrhenius equation. \\ The "
"vertical axis gives the base-10 logarithm of the diffusion coefficient, "
"whereas :numref:`li3po4-diffusivity-31atoms` uses the natural logarithm. "
"For the slope conversion on a base-10 logarithmic axis, see the Technical"
" Notes on the \\ `Arrhenius equation <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/thermal_activation.html#arrhenius-equation>`__\\ ."

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:31
msgid "文献・実験との比較"
msgstr "Comparison with the Literature and Experiment"

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:33
msgid ""
"文献NNP-MDも同じ組成と原子数で600～1200 Kを調べ、活性化エネルギーは0.55 "
"eVでした。薄膜実験では、二次イオン質量分析（SIMS）から0.57～0.58 eV、インピーダンス測定から0.55 "
"eVが報告されています（SIMSのトレーサー拡散係数とインピーダンス測定の伝導度の対応は技術ノートの\\ `トレーサー拡散係数とイオン伝導度 "
"<https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/diffusion.html#tracer-diffusion-"
"and-conductivity>`__）。 `Liらの図11とその解説 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4997242>`__"
msgstr ""
"Li et al. used NNP-MD to study a model of the same composition and atom "
"count over 600–1200 K and obtained an activation energy of 0.55 eV. Thin-"
"film experiments report 0.57–0.58 eV from secondary ion mass spectrometry"
" (SIMS) and 0.55 eV from impedance measurements (see \\ `tracer diffusion"
" coefficient and ionic conductivity <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/diffusion.html#tracer-diffusion-and-conductivity>`__ "
"in the Technical Notes for how the tracer diffusion coefficient measured "
"by SIMS relates to the conductivity measured by impedance). `Li et al., "
"Fig. 11 and the accompanying discussion "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4997242>`__"

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:35
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"本計算の活性化エネルギーは、文献NNP-MDより0.254 eV、実験値より0.254～0.284 "
"eV低いです。文献計算との差は、本計算の直線近似の不確かさより大きく、両計算の原子数は同じです。\\ また、 :numref:`{number}."
" {name} <li3po4-doc-diffusivity-temperature>` の0.43 eVより0.134 "
"eV低いです。31原子モデルとは組成や作製した構造も異なるため、サイズの影響を調べるには他の条件をそろえた比較が必要です。"
msgstr ""
"The activation energy in this work is 0.254 eV below the value from NNP-"
"MD (Li et al.) and 0.254–0.284 eV below the experimental values. The "
"difference from the published calculation is larger than the uncertainty "
"of the straight-line fit in this work, and both calculations used the "
"same number of atoms. \\ It is also 0.134 eV below the 0.43 eV in "
":numref:`{number}. {name} <li3po4-doc-diffusivity-temperature>`. Since "
"the composition and the prepared structure also differ from those of the "
"31-atom model, isolating the effect of size requires a comparison with "
"the other conditions matched."

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:39
msgid "まとめ"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../li3po4/large-model-diffusivity.rst:41
msgid ""
"同じ組成・原子数でも、CHGNetの活性化エネルギーは文献NNP-MDの値を下回り、拡散係数の温度依存性は緩やかでした。\\ "
"図で比較した活性化エネルギーは直線の傾きから求めた値なので、各温度での拡散係数の絶対値を比べるには、文献・実験の拡散係数そのものと照合する必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"Even with the same composition and atom count, the CHGNet activation "
"energy was lower than the value from NNP-MD (Li et al.), and the "
"diffusion coefficient depended less strongly on temperature. \\ Because "
"the activation energies compared in the figure come from the slopes of "
"straight lines, a comparison of absolute diffusion coefficients at each "
"temperature requires checking them directly against the published "
"calculated and experimental diffusion coefficients."

